OL,3,AIntensified Russian strikes are tearing
OL,4,AKyiv apart, warns mayor
OL,5,
OL,6,FIntensified Russian drone and missile
OL,7,Fstrikes are "tearing Kyiv apart", the
OL,8,Fmayor of Ukraine's capital has warned.
OL,10,FVitaliy Klitschko said the city was now
OL,11,Fin a "very dramatic situation" as
OL,12,FMoscow was battering its "critical
OL,13,Finfrastructure, logistics, housing" and
OL,14,Fother key facilities.
OL,16,FHe was speaking after Kyiv's defence
OL,17,Fcouncil held a crisis meeting,
OL,18,Ffollowing new Russian strikes on a key
OL,19,Fbridge that caused traffic chaos. The
OL,20,Fcity's data centres have also been
OL,21,Frecently hit, resulting in internet
OL,22,Foutages.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
