OL,3,AIntensified Russian strikes are tearing
OL,4,AKyiv apart, warns mayor
OL,5,
OL,6,FPresident Vladimir Putin earlier said
OL,7,FRussia was acting in response to
OL,8,FUkraine's strikes on Russian energy
OL,9,Ffacilities, despite the fact that it
OL,10,Fwas Moscow that had first launched such
OL,11,Fattacks.
